<title>GERMANY: Rheinelektra AG 1995/96 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Rheinelektra AG 1995/96 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end June 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   42.3    vs 57.0</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    22.5    vs 67.5</p>
<p>    Income from investments		  90.8    vs 48.6</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 20.70   vs 26.55 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales				  223.9   vs 408.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (per 50 mark share)	   15	vs 15 marks</p>
<p>    Cash flow per share			26.4    vs 25.3 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utilities group is Rheinelektra AG, a subsidiary of RWE AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
